    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d592">

                <pb facs="0996" n="949" xml:id="pg949"/>

                <head>592. Telegram 1840 from Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d592-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1956-05-03">May 3, 1956,
                        midnight</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d592-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d592-1"/>
                <p>1840. From Johnson.</p>
                <p>Wang’s interpreter called tonight requesting that next meeting be postponed until
                    Thursday May 10. I suggested Friday May 11 in view Swiss holiday May 10 to which
                    he agreed. I agreed his suggestion that each only announce to press postponement
                    was by mutual agreement for administrative reasons.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
